R59	Cueing Arg1:T52 Arg2:T51	
R60	Speaker Arg1:T53 Arg2:T51	
R61	Addressee Arg1:T53 Arg2:T50	
T54	Quotation 9000 9184	"H'm! . . . One can't know everything, of course. . . . However large the intellect may be, you can't find room for everything in it. I suppose you still go in chiefly for philosophy?"
R62	Speaker Arg1:T47 Arg2:T54	
