T385	Entity 58499 58502	she
T386	Cue 58503 58510	went on
T387	Quotation 58560 58633	"You are clever, kind, noble. You will be just to father. He is so good."
R468	Speaker Arg1:T385 Arg2:T387	
R469	Cueing Arg1:T386 Arg2:T387	
T388	Entity 58520 58523	his
R470	Addressee Arg1:T388 Arg2:T387	
T389	Quotation 58634 59058	"He is not good; he is just good-natured. Burlesque old uncles like your father, with well-fed, good-natured faces, extraordinarily hospitable and queer, at one time used to touch me and amuse me in novels and in farces and in life; now I dislike them. They are egoists to the marrow of their bones. What disgusts me most of all is their being so well-fed, and that purely bovine, purely hoggish optimism of a full stomach."
R471	Addressee Arg1:T385 Arg2:T389	
R472	Speaker Arg1:T388 Arg2:T389	
